  == Pick's Theorem
  Consider a polygon which vertices are all lattice points.\
  Let $i$ = number of points inside the polygon.\
  Let $b$ = number of points on the boundary of the polygon.\
  Then we have the following formula:\
  $ "Area" = i + b \/ 2 - 1 $
